{"title":"Dune Alpha","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .15</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-alpha\" data-map-level=\"28\">Show level 28 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 2 total, 2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 100% of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 1/1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-1243.6px,-1556.6px)\"><img src=\"tiles/4/3/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/3/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/4/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/4/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1024px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/5/5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1280px\"><img src=\"tiles/4/5/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1280px;top:1536px\"><i style=\"left:1217.6px;top:1547.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1191.0px;top:1611.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1338.5px;top:1516.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1227.5px;top:1550.8px\"></i></div><figcaption>Marauder Warcamp</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dune-alpha\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Desert Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/sand-jackal\">Sand Jackal</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\">Desert Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/a30ad945729791035484.webp\" alt=\"Dune Alpha\"></div><h3>Dune Alpha</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 28)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Desert Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>106</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}